{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"mukul975--anthropic-cybersecurity-skills--performing-kubernetes-etcd-security-assessment","name":"performing-kubernetes-etcd-security-assessment","description":"Assesses the security posture of the etcd cluster backing Kubernetes: encryption at rest, TLS peer and client transport, access control, backup encryption, and network isolation. Use when auditing or hardening a control plane, reviewing whether Secrets are encrypted at rest, or protecting etcd backups, since etcd stores Secrets, RBAC policy, and ConfigMaps in plaintext by default. Keywords: etcd, EncryptionConfiguration, encryption at rest, peer TLS, snapshot, backup, control plane. Do not use for broad cluster-wide CIS checks - use performing-kubernetes-cis-benchmark-with-kube-bench.","category":"Security","tags":["performing","kubernetes","etcd","security","assessment","assesses","posture","cluster","backing","encryption","at","rest","tls","peer","client","transport","access","control"],"repo":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","owner":"mukul975","stars":34277,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"Apache-2.0","licensePath":"skills/performing-kubernetes-etcd-security-assessment/LICENSE","revision":"54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57","path":"skills/performing-kubernetes-etcd-security-assessment","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills/tree/54a798831d2266a3ca61ce68a7acb80b81160d57/skills/performing-kubernetes-etcd-security-assessment","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:14:06.196Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T04:32:42Z","fileCount":8,"bytes":38740,"sha256":"4523f85f88f460e551d479991b79e367366a907d3ba3a2d5ab64efab7e8fcd51","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"LICENSE","sourcePath":"skills/performing-kubernetes-etcd-security-assessment/LICENSE","bytes":11255,"sha256":"a941b58ef0ba43a31e24ae7ece1b743a585efed9e37792b9ca063e0798be1cbe","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills/54a798831d2266